"bullet\">Compare yourself to the audio.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob04re4aud01", "type": "audio"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "type": "MRW"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le02ob04re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le02ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le02ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le02ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thank you for joining me today, Ms. Goodman ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ms. Goodman</span>: You're welcome.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: My readers are very concerned with global warming. What knowledge can you add to the discussion?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ms. Goodman</span>:  One effect of global warming could be drought. In some arid places, it does not rain much and the trees depend on water from lakes and rivers. When the temperature rises, water evaporates faster. If the temperature were to rise, even by three degrees, the water in these areas would evaporate and cause a water shortage. The soil would be torn up by dryness and all that would remain on the plants would be the thorns."}, {"time": "37000", "image": "engenn9le02ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's terrible, but ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ms. Goodman</span>: Yes, it is. A drought could also increase the rate of global warming. With fewer plants to take carbon dioxide out of the air, the atmosphere would continue to heat up and cause other drastic changes throughout the world.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: My readers would like to know ..."}, {"time": "56500", "image": "engenn9le02ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Goodman</span>:  Thanks to projects that install rain collection tanks in arid countries, only a tenth of the world's population remains thirsty and living in make-shift tents for shelter from the sun.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Unfortunately that's all the time we have today ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ms. Goodman</span>:  Thank you for having me."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Environment", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "An Effect of Global Warming", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe environmental change in social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Minimal Pairs - <span class=\"italic\">t</span> and <span class=\"italic\">th</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Minimal Pairs are two words that sound similar, except for one sound.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The sounds <span class=\"italic\">t</span> and <span class=\"italic\">th</span> are quite different.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To make the sound <span class=\"italic\">t</span>, your tongue touches the area behind your top front teeth (alveolar ridge). The sound <span class=\"italic\">t</span> is unvoiced. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The make the sound <span class=\"italic\">th</span>, your tongue sits between your teeth and the air passes around the tongue. The sound is unvoiced. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here are a list of minimal pairs with the <span class=\"italic\">t</span> and <span class=\"italic\">th</span> sounds. As you read them, focus on the difference between the two sounds.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">t</span> sound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">th</span> sound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tree\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"three\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"torn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thorn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tanks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thanks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tenth\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "In some arid places, it does not rain much and the trees depend on water from lakes and rivers. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If the temperature were to rise, even by three degrees, the water in these areas would evaporate and cause a water shortage.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The soil would be torn up by dryness and all that would remain on the plants would be the thorns. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Thanks to projects that install rain collection tanks in arid countries, only a tenth of the world's population remains thirsty and living in make-shift tents for shelter from the sun.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Intonation of Finished and Unfinished Ideas", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Intonation tells us a lot about how someone feels and whether they have completed their thoughts or not. It is important to listen carefully to the rise and fall of people's voices. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In English, there are three intonation patterns:<ol><li>Falling</li><li>Rising</li><li>Partial Falling </li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You should use <span class=\"strong\">falling</span> intonation at the end of a thought group, sentence or an information question to tell the listener that you are finished with that statement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">My readers are very concerned with global <span class=\"strong\">warming<span>.\u2935 </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Likewise, your pitch will only <span class=\"strong\">partially fall</span> at the end of a thought group to:<ul><li>give the listener's brain time to \u201cdigest\u201d the speech; and</li><li>tell the listener that you are not finished speaking.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">That's terrible, <span class=\"strong\">but </span> ... </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Thank you for joining me today, Ms. Goodman ... (PARTIALLY DOWN)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You're welcome. (DOWN)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "What knowledge can you add to the discussion? (DOWN)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That's terrible, but ... (PARTIALLY DOWN)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My readers would like to know ... (PARTIALLY DOWN)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should use <span class=\"strong\">rising</span> intonation at the end of a yes/no question. The rising pitch indicates to the listener that you would like an answer. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Are you concerned about global <span class=\"strong\">warming</span>? \u2934</span> ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "drought ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a long period of dry weather and no rain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: One effect of global warming could be drought.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk to an expert about global warming.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "arid ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very dry because of a lack of rain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In some arid places, it does not rain. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "thorn ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a sharp point that grows on the stem of a plant such as a rose or a cactus", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: All that would remain on the plants would be the thorns. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to evaporate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to change from a liquid to a gas", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The water in these areas would evaporate and cause a water shortage.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "make-shift ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "temporary and \u200blow \u200bquality, but used because of a \u200bsudden need", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A  tenth of the world's population remains thirsty and living in make-shift tents for shelter from the Sun.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to install", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to put equipment somewhere and connect it so that it is ready to be used", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  There are projects that install rain collection tanks in arid countries.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Watch the movie <span class=\"italic\">An Inconvenient Truth</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down any familiar words or phrases that you hear related to the environment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Summarize the movie in a paragraph and share your summary with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss the ideas presented in the movie and your opinion on global warming.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I describe and discuss environmental problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I watch the movie <span class=\"italic\">An Inconvenient Truth</span> and write a summary of it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen for familiar words and phrases.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}], "type": "sena"}